<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Motors domestic output up 12.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Motors domestic output up 12.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Friday its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas production in May were, with percentage changes from a year earlier, as follows:</p>
<p> Production	   94,011   up   12.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		64,707   up   19.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     29,304   down  0.4 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales     41,226   down 14.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		20,365   down 12.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     20,861   down 16.5 percent</p>
<p> Exports		36,753   up   74.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		24,450   up   89.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     12,303   up   51.6 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    66,601   up    8.1 percent</p>
</text>
